(48, 'Furk.Net', 'Furk', 'Furk', '<h2>Furk.Net Service limits described</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li><strong>B/W (Bandwidth):</strong>&nbsp;limit of HTTP bandwidth (traffic) per month. i.e. amount of data you download from our servers to your computer. No other bandwidth is counted. If you exceed your limit you can always&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.furk.net/billing/addons\">purchase extra bandwidth</a>&nbsp;which will be carried over to the next month.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Dls (Acitve downloads):</strong>&nbsp;the limit for active downloads from other sources such as other sites and networks to our servers. Bandwidth (incoming for us) itself is not counted. The limit applies to number of active downloads and to total size of all active downloads. As most downloads are quite fast only 1-2% users are affected by this limit.</li>\r\n	<li>If you don&#39;t understand the limits terminology then just ignore it. Most likely the limits will not apply to you.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h2>Features&nbsp;Furk Premium Key</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Search BitTorrents from all top BitTorrent sites and use Furk.net as a BitTorrent client. You provide a link to .torrent file - you get regular http (and https) links for ultra fast download. Features include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Comments and ratings are agregated from all sites</li>\r\n	<li>All files are checked on our servers by an anti-virus</li>\r\n	<li>Media info for video torrents: screenshots, audio samples and codecs info.</li>\r\n	<li>If a torrent has been downloaded via the proxy by other user it will be cached and available for instant download. Current cache size is over&nbsp;<strong>1000TB</strong></li>\r\n	<li>Video and audio files are playable directly from our servers. You don&#39;t need to download if you just plan to watch it once. Supported players: VLC, MPlayer, SMPlayer and probably other free players.</li>\r\n	<li>Video files are playable directly from Media Centers as well. Currently supported media centers: XMBC (by addon) and plugins for other will be released soon</li>\r\n	<li>Friendly and fast support</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h2>What&#39;s difference?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>You can download torrents faster then you can do it using a desktop BitTorrent client. All our servers are on fast network.</li>\r\n	<li>You don&#39;t need to keep your computer on while downloading torrents on slow speed from BitTorrent network.</li>\r\n	<li>Some ISPs block or throttle BitTorrent traffic but never do this for HTTP traffic. Even if your ISP is trottling HTTP you can download using HTTPs and non-standard ports.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n', '1532851485.png', 'furknet-premium-key-premium-key-reseller', 'Furk.Net Premium Key, Buy Furk.Net Premium Key via Paypal get 2% bonus', 'Buy Furk.Net Premium Key via paypal, wmz at BuyPremiumKey reseller you will receive 2% bonus from us. We are best official reseller Furk.Net premium key voucher', 'Furk.Net premium account, Furk.Net reseller paypal, Furk.Net reseller, Furk.Net key, Furk.Net account, Furk.Net premium, key Furk.Net, link generator Furk.Net, link Furk.Net premium, premium, premium account, premium how to buy Furk.Net premium account paypal, premium key, premium link generator Furk.Net, premium paypal, Reseller, ryshare voucher, ryu share premium account, Furk.Net, Furk.Net account, Furk.Net buy, Furk.Net buy premium, Furk.Net cookie, Furk.Net id, Furk.Net key, Furk.Net link, buy Furk.Net at buypremiumkey.com, buy premium key, buy premium key com, buy Furk.Net account, buy Furk.Net key 0.02356511', '2018-05-25 09:30:07', '2019-02-25 17:22:15', 1, NULL, 1, 0, 'https://www.furk.net', 4459, 12, 'https://www.furk.net/t/resellers', 1, '1532851485.jpg', 1, 0),
