(52, 'RapidFileShare.net', 'RapidFileShare', 'RapidFileShare', '<h2>What is RapidFileShare?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>RapidFileShare is a file hosting provider. We offer online storage/remote backup capacity, sophisticated uploading and downloading tools.&nbsp;<br />\r\nWith RapidFileShare you can host files, images, videos, audio and flash on the same place.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why should I use RapidFileShare?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Whenever you need to send a file that is too large for e-mail, RapidFileShare can help. If you need secure remote storage capacity for off-site backups, RapidFileShare offers solutions for you. If you want to access personal data from a variety of computers and don&#39;t want to carry around a USB stick, RapidFileShare is a perfect way of doing so.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Can I search for files other people uploaded?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No, because not everyone wishes to share the files they upload with everyone else. This way RapidFileShare can be used to share files with anyone you choose to, as well as keep it for yourself as a backup or to download from anywhere in the world.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>What kind of files can be uploaded?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>All kinds: from your party photos to an important document. The only restrictions are for pornography, nudity, sexual images and any kind offensive material, and, of course, copyrighted material.<br />\r\nPlease refer to our&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.rapidfileshare.net/tos.html\">TOS</a>&nbsp;for more info on RapidFileShare terms of service.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>How to delete a file I uploaded?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>To delete a file you uploaded you must use Delete Link that was provided to you after the upload proccess.&nbsp;<br />\r\nIf you lost your removal code you can simply wait until the file expires so it will be automatically removed from our site.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Can I hotlink the stuff I upload?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No. Hotlinking is not allowed on any kind of files uploaded to our servers.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>I