(21, 'How to activate AlfaFile Premium Key, AlfaFile Coupon Code?', 'how-to-activate-alfafile-premium-key-alfafile-coupon-code', '<h2>Activate AlfaFile Premium Key, AlfaFile Premium Coupon code.</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>After you get the AlfaFile Premium Key&nbsp;from Buypremiumkey.com reseller, you follow these steps to activate the AlfaFile Premium Key:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Please log into your AlfaFile account first.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>( If you don&#39;t have a AlfaFile&nbsp;account,&nbsp;you just need to register free account:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://alfafile.net/user/signup\" target=\"_blank\">https://alfafile.net/user/signup</a>&nbsp;)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. You will receive a premium key / coupon that you can activate here:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://alfafile.net/payment/coupon\" target=\"_blank\">https://alfafile.net/payment/coupon</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Please enter your coupon code in &quot;Coupon Code&quot; and click &quot;Pay&quot; to become Premium user.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"How to activate alfafile premium key / alfafile premium coupon code\" src=\"http://buypremiumkey.com/images/news/1527927472.png\" style=\"width:100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Thank you for using the service of <a href=\"http://buypremiumkey.com\">buypremiumkey.com</a> reseller!</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Have a nice day!</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Buypremiumkey.com reseller</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n</ol>\r\n', 'How to activate Alfafile Premium Key at alfafile.net|BuyPremiumKey.Com', 'BuyPremiumKey is official reseller of Alfafile.net premium key. You can buy Alfafile premium coupon, voucher, coupon プレミアムキー  via Paypal, Visa/Master Card, wmz', 'AlfaFile premium account, AlfaFile reseller paypal, AlfaFile reseller, AlfaFile key, AlfaFile account, AlfaFile premium, key AlfaFile, link generator AlfaFile, link AlfaFile premium, premium, premium account, activate AlfaFile, how to activate AlfaFile, AlfaFile activate, AlfaFile free, AlfaFile bonus, AlfaFile voucher, AlfaFile coupon', '2018-0