(22, 'How to activate Uploadgig Premium Key, Uploadgig Coupon Code?', 'how-to-activate-uploadgig-premium-key-uploadgig-coupon-code', '<h2>Activate Uploadgig premium key, premium account.</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>We DO NOT sell UploadGIG premium key. Use Buypremiumkey.com reseller to buy UploadGIG premium account or upgrade UploadGIG account to premium anytime, anywhere</p>\r\n\r\n<p>After you get the Uploadgig Premium Key&nbsp;from Buypremiumkey.com reseller, you follow these steps to activate the Uploadgig Premium Key:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1.&nbsp;Register an account at&nbsp;<a href=\"https://uploadgig.com/register\">https://uploadgig.com/register</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.&nbsp;Send us your registered email (Please reply at the email of the order we sent you)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3.&nbsp;After confirming your payment is completed, we will upgrade your account on uploadgig.com through the email you provided.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4.&nbsp;You login to uploadgig, your account has been upgraded to premium.</p>\r\n', 'How to activate Uploadgig Premium Key | BuyPremiumKey.Com Reseller', 'BuyPremiumKey.com is official reseller of Uploadgig premium key. You can buy Uploadgig premium key, coupon, voucher via Paypal, Visa/Master Card, Webmoney.', 'Uploadgig premium account, Uploadgig reseller paypal, Uploadgig reseller, Uploadgig key, Uploadgig account, Uploadgig premium, key Uploadgig, link generator Uploadgig, link Uploadgig premium, premium, premium account, activate Uploadgig, how to activate Uploadgig, Uploadgig activate, Uploadgig free, Uploadgig bonus, Uploadgig voucher, Uploadgig coupon', '2018-06-02 09:00:33', '2018-10-06 23:01:14', 2, 279, 29),
