(63, 'How to activate FileFox premium key, FileFox premium account?', 'how-to-activate-filefox-premium-key-filefox-premium-account', '<p>1. You will receive a Filefox premium voucher like this:&nbsp;<strong>79tewgdaw434gd</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. You should be log in :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://filefox.cc/login.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://filefox.cc/login.html</a>&nbsp;( If you haven&#39;t account at Filefox, you just need to sign up:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://filefox.cc/?op=registration\" target=\"_blank\">https://filefox.cc/?op=registration</a>&nbsp;)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Make sure you are logged in. Then access this link:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://filefox.cc/?op=my_account\" target=\"_blank\">https://filefox.cc/?op=my_account</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Put your voucher code in field &quot;<strong>Apply Premium Key</strong>&quot;, and click on &quot;<strong>Apply</strong>&quot;</p>\r\n', 'How to activate FileFox premium key, account | FileFox.cc Reseller', 'How to activate FileFox Premium Key? Buy FileFox Premium Key, Premium Account via Paypal, Visa Master card at Buypremiumkey.com reseller get 2% bonus.', 'FileFox , Activate FileFox Account, Activate  FileFox premium, Activate FileFox Voucher, Activate  FileFox coupon code, FileFox paypal, FileFox reseller', '2018-09-05 02:56:24', '2018-10-07 01:13:26', 2, 60, 68),
(64, 'How to activate Bitport premium key, Bitport premium account?', 'how-to-activate-bitport-premium-key-bitport-premium-account', '<p>1. You will receive a&nbsp;Bitport premium voucher&nbsp;like this:<strong> YYYYYYYYY783YYY</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. You should be log in :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://bitport.io/login\" target=\"_blank\">https://bitport.io/login</a>&nbsp;(If you haven&#39;t account at Bitport, you just need to sign up:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://bitport.io/new-account\" target=\"_blank\">https://bitport.io/new-account</a>)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Make sure you are logged in. Then access this link:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://bitport.io/voucher\" target=\"_blank\">https://bitport.io/voucher</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Put your voucher code in field &quot;<strong>Enter Voucher Code</strong>&quot;, and click on &quot;<strong>Redeem</strong>&quot;</p>\r\n', 'How to activate Bitport premium key, account | Bitport.io Reseller', 'How to activate Bitport Premium Key? Buy Bitport Premium Key, Premium Account via Paypal, Visa Master card at Buypremiumkey.com reseller get 2% bonus.', 'Bitport , Activate Bitport Account, Activate  Bitport premium, Activate Bitport Voucher, Activate  Bitport coupon code, Bitport paypal, Bitport reseller', '2018-09-05 05:14:09', '2018-10-07 21:56:47', 2, 111, 69),
(65, 'How to activate World-Files Premium Key?', 'how-to-activate-world-files-premium-key', '<p>After you get the World-Files Premium Key from BuyPremiumKey.com reseller, you follow these steps to activate the World-Files Premium Key:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>You will receive a voucher / coupon like this: 294zdpbz38icgade56</li>\r\n	<li>Login your World-Files account or register a new World-Files account at:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://dlempire.net/users/sign_up/\" target=\"_blank\">https://world-files.com/register.html</a></li>\r\n	<li>Make sure you are logged in, and access to your account by access this link:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://world-files.com/?op=my_account\" target=\"_blank\">https://world-files.com/?op=my_account</a></li>\r\n	<li>Put your premium key / voucher code in field &quot;<strong>Apply Premium Key</strong>&quot;, and click on &quot;<strong>Apply</strong>&quot;</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n', 'How to activate World-Files Premium Key | World-Files.com Reseller', 'BuyPremiumKey.com is official reseller of World-Files premium key. You can buy World-Files premium key, coupon, voucher via Paypal, Visa/Master Card, Webmoney.', 'World-Files premium account, World-Files reseller paypal, World-Files reseller, World-Files key, World-Files account, World-Files premium, key World-Files , link generator World-Files, link World-Files premium, premium, premium account, activate World-Files, how to activate World-Files, World-Files activate, World-Files free, World-Files bonus, World-Files voucher, World-Files coupon', '2018-10-03 07:06:41', '2021-08-30 18:05:03', 2, 13, 63);
